<title>USA: Bainbridge Island SD, Wash., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Bainbridge Island SD, Wash., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said it won $17 million of Bainbridge Island School District No 303, Wash., general obligation bonds, series 1997A, with a true interest cost of 5.49 percent.</p>
</text>
